Build changes in build/next/index.ts (ROADMAP P0-4, P0-5; DV-13).

- Bundle Triage's utility-process modules as entry points; they run in
  utility processes started through IUtilityProcessWorkerWorkbenchService:
  vs/triage/node/helloEngineBrokerMain (the hello engine's broker),
  vs/triage/node/projectModelMain (the model service, Rust addon) and
  vs/triage/node/edaEngineBrokerMain (the EDA engine's broker, P1-2).
- TRIAGE_SEQUENTIAL_BUNDLES: bundle the entry points one at a time, as
  upstream already does for its mobile target, instead of all 28 at once.
  Unset, nothing changes. See 0003 for the memory measurements.

